# A module of defect 2143's cases (lane lane-witnessed-seed, 2026-10-19): a
# parameter wider than the header's `int`, told in the build that tells the
# root's own refusal since defect 2143's other half (2026-10-25,
# M-rechecked-issues), and a value only the probe sees.

extern "fixedbugs-2128-narrow.h"
    function narrow(x: i64) -> i32  #~ ffi_parameter_type

extern "fixedbugs-2128-values.h"
    constant K_DIV: i64  #~ ffi_constant_type

function got() -> i64
    return to_i64(narrow(x: 3)).must() + K_DIV
